// HONESTY-SWEEP r1 (2026-11-07) - probe Q-HS7 for the capture lane (review N1).
// Queue: docs/pine/capture-queue-2026-11-07-honesty-sweep.md
// Chart: AMEX:SPY 1D, inputs at defaults, AFTER THE CLOSE. Read each line's style from the chart model.
// The question is a confirmation: a helper computing the style, called with a NAMED argument, draws the style
// the helper returns (the engine withholds these lines today because its drawing door does not read the call).
//
//   N01  st(m = pickA): a default-less switch over an uncovered input, matched ("A"): dashed expected
//   N02  st(m = pickZ): the same, unmatched ("Z"): see Q-HS1 L03 (an `na` style)
//   N03  sd(m = pickA): a switch WITH a default arm, matched: dashed expected
//   N04  sd(m = pickZ): the same, the default arm: dotted expected
//@version=6
indicator("vw-hs7-enum-named-call", overlay = true)
pickZ = input.string("Z", "unmatched", options = ["A", "B", "Z"])
pickA = input.string("A", "matched", options = ["A", "B", "Z"])
st(m) =>
    switch m
        "A" => line.style_dashed
        "B" => line.style_dotted
sd(m) =>
    switch m
        "A" => line.style_dashed
        => line.style_dotted
if barstate.islast
    line.new(bar_index - 10, high, bar_index, high, style = st(m = pickA))
    line.new(bar_index - 10, low, bar_index, low, style = st(m = pickZ))
    line.new(bar_index - 10, close, bar_index, close, style = sd(m = pickA))
    line.new(bar_index - 10, open, bar_index, open, style = sd(m = pickZ))
plot(close, "close")
